      ],
      "sha256": "afd4dcb80875565360fed98837cb6eb00a1e32fafba88c2c426653b27d2d2bff",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 8. Before-and-after bar-chart pair used to elicit natural-language editing requests. Both plots show Adam, Bobby and Charlie with the same Case 1 and Case 2 bar heights. Plot A uses solid red and blue bars, a grid and a legend to the right. Plot B removes the grid, changes the bars to light salmon and pale blue with diagonal hatching, and moves the legend below the plot."
    }
